{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0134_1000_p", "source_sha256": "458d7f327fc0fa36f1e7cdabc391c6af75fa16afdadf6882456d36e7d0c5bdcb", "ja": "（今日は茜と妖怪ものの撮影に来ている。\n撮影はオンスケジュールで進み、休憩時間になった）", "zh": "（今天陪茜来拍摄妖怪作品。\n拍摄按照流程进行，现在来到了休息时间。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0134_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "d342a82353d37fc589ecc67ad3fb03fa6dff946b345fcec2ae9522cda3e149ec", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、お疲れ～！\nねえねえ、茜ちゃんの演技どうだった？", "zh": "小{$P$}，辛苦了～！\n欸欸，小茜演得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0134_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "adb8a78aaebda95f84f7ec880fed3d8c2c60f660d304f39e455f962dfa041b06", "ja": "そんな端っこにいないで、近くで見たらいいのに。\n最高にカワイイ猫又の茜ちゃんを！", "zh": "干嘛站在角落，靠近一点看嘛。\n看看可爱到不行的猫又小茜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0134_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f856301d176a7617e54b5cb64e2ca345dae45c2f5dac5b29603db2e6c88a744b", "ja": "いや、ここからでも見えるから……それより、\n撮影は順調に進んでるみたいだな。安心したよ。", "zh": "不用，我在这边就看得很清楚了……\n倒是拍摄好像进行得很顺利，我放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0134_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "b27c45cc55d466588a8fa88ddd4c772082e1d22a7512c5168a4a5d22de6808d9", "ja": "当然だよ、{$P$}ちゃん！\n今回の猫又役、茜ちゃん、運命感じちゃったからね。", "zh": "当然啰，小{$P$}！\n因为小茜对这次的猫又角色，有命中注定的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0134_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "05271881f9bf9177980be69bf5cd8c8f175c9d342e0fd506d57c78da51cc5259", "ja": "町中の愛されキャラである、妖怪猫又！\nカンペキなまでのハマり役だと思うな～、うん！", "zh": "深受村民喜爱的角色，妖怪猫又！\n简直是为小茜量身订做的角色呢～嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0134_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2b5dc361d57b5951d50b8d12199335125be43a5991d843730cab94498a860943", "ja": "愛されキャラ？\nどっちかっていうと、憎まれ役だったような……。", "zh": "受喜爱的角色？\n硬要说的话，这好像是个讨人厌的角色耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0134_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "057e72cfec95f05844124a1dea226b67d799acf7d3fa045ca1d8dd375cdda48a", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、甘いよ！\n台本の読み込みが甘ーい！", "zh": "小{$P$}，太天真了！\n你对剧本的理解还不够仔细～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0134_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "b940aea8ede39964a88ef06c0916c3efa38f8c36042bd95d7fab0354019b807b", "ja": "たしかに猫又は、仲間と一緒にお魚を盗みすぎて\n町の人たちにガッツリ怒られたりもするけどさ！", "zh": "虽然猫又跟伙伴一起偷了太多鱼，\n的确也是会被村民破口大骂！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0134_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d164b73e19e998d5d9cb07a403756357d45f84ae6632fb724dfdedc675339de5", "ja": "ガッツリ怒られてちゃダメじゃないか……。", "zh": "被破口大骂不是很不应该吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0134_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "20449917da071e23b31be3df5600850b68a79ada092100d19b668385760e4441", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、最後まで聞いてよ！\nでも最後はみんな、茜ちゃんを許してくれるの！", "zh": "小{$P$}，听小茜说完！\n但最后大家都会原谅小茜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0134_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "5015e14c76bb042ce43d91a304f11544902148b12d69611c3f24a0719bb9b364", "ja": "一緒に歌って踊って、ハッピーエンドなんだよ！\nこれを愛されキャラと言わずして、なんと言おうか！", "zh": "大家一起唱歌跳舞，迎接幸福快乐的结局！\n这不叫受喜爱的角色，那叫什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0134_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b8ff3010876abc0f161e5bc52126d20c917efbee14859fc0216a3b6930e5a79e", "ja": "なるほど、言われてみれば確かにその通りだ。\nそういう解釈もできるな。", "zh": "原来如此，经你这么一说，的确有道理。\n也是可以这么解读呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0134_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "6dcaad9d29b5f42b113b258c1bf92729b2edd8469f6100d572e71e3641508b91", "ja": "そう！　つまり茜ちゃんこそが、愛されキャラ！\nだから最後は、なんとなく許されてしまうのだ！", "zh": "没错！换句话说，小茜就是受喜爱的角色！\n所以最后大家都会默默原谅小茜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0134_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "46600a14015362bd366bf41704f86791aa01cd8100e9401a51901c268b06f40e", "ja": "これって、日ごろの茜ちゃんそのものだよね！\nね、{$P$}ちゃん！", "zh": "这就是小茜平时的写照呢！\n对不对，小{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0134_1015_p", "source_sha256": "9bd9950a84a949941f316fdd52c8285bc812866379f08321ff8d017d13613106", "ja": "そうか……。\nなんとなく許されてるっていう自覚はあったんだな。", "zh": "这样啊……\n原来你自己有感觉到大家都是默默原谅你啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0134_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "3cc9d9b39ab5ab724f37f9813ea0d4a7a12e905111c21f69ecc6dc993429f138", "ja": "え！？　い、いやいや！　許されようとしなくても、\n許されてしまうのが茜ちゃんだから！　ね！", "zh": "咦！？不、不不不！即使不求对方的原谅，\n最后还是会被原谅，这才是小茜！对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0134_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "25803ec085d5af789db70bb84eaccc8c2f907de0d3cad990ed6454c3613dec7a", "ja": "そ、そんなことより{$P$}ちゃん！\nそろそろ、お祭りのシーンの撮影が始まるよ？", "zh": "不、不说这个了，小{$P$}！\n差不多要开始拍摄祭典那一幕啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0134_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "adee27b67a3e589705cc2e64bab2ab7240cf7e41287207b8867d9745986d53aa", "ja": "クライマックスの、大切なシーンだよ！\n茜ちゃんを本気にさせないと！　プリンとかで！", "zh": "这可是剧中高潮的重要场景！\n你要让小茜认真起来才行！用布丁之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0134_1019_p", "source_sha256": "751073e9e3cb84a748df3171ad0e454d1d7e65f40c27f8395951a05242aa160a", "ja": "わかったわかった。\n帰りに、プリンをご馳走すればいいんだな？", "zh": "好啦好啦。\n回去时请你吃布丁就行了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0134_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "041fd7b36a78b3fd7f6f5f9a569a8d0b56149a43ff5800908be5515142ebb467", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、そんな雑なプリンで\n納得すると思ってるの？　もっと心をこめて！　はい！", "zh": "小{$P$}，你以为那种随便的布丁\n小茜会接受吗？再更有诚意一点！来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0134_1021_p", "source_sha256": "17ee35ec805952ec11b18a74c4241f1b2355bd678e1b313892e1a1a916db18a0", "ja": "それじゃ、心をこめてご馳走するから……\n茜も心をこめて撮影、よろしくな！", "zh": "那就，我会诚心诚意请客的……\n所以茜也要用心拍摄，拜托啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0134_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "79ad891e96f0680d6e67fc592c43a1f520182ba8d4506ac22d9a8492348da368", "ja": "オッケー！　茜ちゃんの最高の演技、約束するよ！\n茜ちゃんの勇姿、その目に焼き付けるがいい～！", "zh": "OK！小茜答应你会展现最顶尖的演技！\n把小茜的英姿好好烙印在眼底吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0134_1023_p", "source_sha256": "d70a541018c1c04e8736f8493265c411855e9d9ba53bd757a8de13cf32f29eab", "ja": "（猫又に魚をご馳走してあげた人達も、\nきっとこんな気持ちだったんだろうな……）", "zh": "（给猫又吃鱼的那些人，\n肯定也是这样的心情吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
